{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "9da51d0ac0ef5d841d8ceacb05067ec5aa15d80dd19e792f4b2eac4a6c053555", "ja": "二人で物語を", "zh": "两人一同书写的故事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e9748a819b1864a772d26218baf61aa48266138731681b41e28fc20f584f7d8", "ja": "二人で物語を作るという提案に雪歩は緊張す\nるが、真は雪歩と一緒なら大丈夫と前向き。\n真と話すうちに雪歩も前向きになっていき、\nプロデューサーの元にはやってみますという\n返答が届くのだった。", "zh": "雪步对于两人一起创作故事的提议感到紧张，\n但真积极地表示，只要和雪步一起就没问题。\n在和真交谈的过程中，雪步也逐渐变得积极起来，\n最终，制作人收到了她“我会试试”的回复。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "1c2e297060925590ab068e32e948e0e6cb456e551eb458d778232734e413f8f5", "ja": "物語がテーマのツインライブ、かぁ。\n{$P$}も面白いこと考えるよね。", "zh": "以故事为主题的双人演唱会啊。\n{$P$}也真是能想出有意思的点子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "722f61f609ae96181a822057040ac55dbef722abb27cdc74624c2ad40d9f6179", "ja": "雪歩……。やっぱり、不安？", "zh": "雪步……果然，还是不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4e13dd6f3ecb8e4b07624ebb0ae0cdaf2d3784424a1ef0c45979053d916d124d", "ja": "あ、うん……。ライブは嬉しいし、\n私も楽しそうだと思ったよ……。思ったけど……。", "zh": "啊，嗯……虽然能参加演唱会很开心，\n我也觉得应该会很有意思……是这么觉得，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9e3a4f7c8327eb1931090a131b9c1061ad367d7fb9970d74c762d1786bb2b2ce", "ja": "覚えることもたくさんあって、それだけでも大変なのに\nその上、物語まで考えるなんて……！", "zh": "要记的东西很多，光是这些就够辛苦了，居然还要构思故事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "84fc588db1b6a60dbd62be8d04cd681858312037a90594a3dcf4aa608068f09f", "ja": "そうだよね……わかるよ。\nボクも正直、できるのかな？って思ったもん。", "zh": "是啊……我明白你的感受。\n说实话，我也曾想过，自己真的能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "909c5438b445a7396305ad1907eb6f7b6b3e04d74175afcf3fe884fd9a905175", "ja": "でもね、やっぱり思っちゃうんだ。\n雪歩と一緒なら大丈夫かも！って。", "zh": "但是啊，我还是会忍不住想——\n要是和雪步一起的话，说不定就没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "a5eb656d4fceb7377241a75176a819979519cb97bbc762c399b5fc6e1279c45a", "ja": "ボクたち、今までいろんなことを乗り越えてきたよね？\nだから今回も、なんとかなるかもって。", "zh": "我们一路走来，克服了各种各样的困难，对吧？\n所以我觉得，这次或许也能想办法解决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "8aee2e636bcfc1090cce910e82728715e3256b5d947afd8980f90b2a634e8005", "ja": "だって、雪歩の頑張る姿をみてると、\nボクもますます頑張れちゃうからさ！", "zh": "因为看到雪步努力的样子，我也会更加努力嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2fe56e7603e90d1f1b708164f4b4c8112f9e13333e5de47dbc62c52e9ea77988", "ja": "ま、真ちゃん……！", "zh": "真、真……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "a33e7d5989e5c53f1776566f475110a345248e77f2ddf1de56339d2e8847a3bb", "ja": "それに！　ボクたちが物語を考えるってことは、\nつまり、好きな話にしていいってことだよね？", "zh": "而且！既然要由我们来构思故事，\n也就是说，可以写成自己喜欢的故事，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "8e7168f49b4d742d1cbcfc08532c970e4b608d212fde88d4acd154c3170f5489", "ja": "たとえば、プリップリのお姫様が出てくる話にしたら\nボクがプリップリの衣装を着られるんだよね！？", "zh": "比如说，要是编个有活力的小公主登场的故事，\n我就能穿上活力十足的服装了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1f8ea1d3bfecef4aa5fe707ad32bae2376051bf4a880e9f8c4109341063f58c2", "ja": "ま、真ちゃん……？", "zh": "真……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "6e9ad700828063dd1327d81520890d47e23fe4d3789851328dfed9da61614f7c", "ja": "あ、いや、たとえばの話ね？　そんな風に、ボクたちの\n好きなものを取り入れると、やる気出そうだなぁって！", "zh": "啊，不，我只是打个比方哦？像这样，把我们喜欢的东西融入进去，感觉就会更有干劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "22c28d2e4f27bc6050811366cfddfe45abe776d385ecc4cc8ca3af7531e19c6c", "ja": "ほら、ぬいぐるみがたくさん出てくる話にしたら……\nステージもぬいぐるみがいっぱいの幸せ空間になるし♪", "zh": "你看，要是把故事设定成会出现很多毛绒玩偶的那种……舞台也会变成充满毛绒玩偶的幸福空间♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d3528ae1315a61fcf4e16e66589b27aa3b584b98e0660a7f953d849272992a1b", "ja": "幸せ空間……ふふっ、そうだね。\nじゃあ私なら、好きな物は……焼肉……宇宙……？", "zh": "幸福空间……呵呵，是呢。\n那换作我的话，喜欢的东西是……烤肉……宇宙……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "d59bbfa07a79f376e324488fe7edd7fc323f21c3e048f4867fd1259eb9984098", "ja": "うーん。となると、グルメかSFかぁ。専門的だね……\nうん、シュールでいいと思うよ♪", "zh": "嗯——这么说来，就是美食或者科幻了啊。真专业……\n嗯，我觉得这种超现实风格也不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "82c3e56ddbec439a3a12a94cb17c2d832da2f57526a880891031b1a8166e1b39", "ja": "でも、やっぱり雪歩には詩を書いてほしいかな。\nそれをボクが朗読するとか！", "zh": "不过，我还是希望雪步能写诗。\n然后由我来朗读之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3cb7412d756cd30cf0b91442cdf6644f136e431a10e0642850002628770a1eac", "ja": "ひぅ！　それは……ちょっぴり嬉しい気もするけど、\nそれを隣で聞いてるのは、拷問に等しいかも……！", "zh": "呜！那个……虽然感觉有点开心，可是要在旁边听你朗读，可能就和受刑差不多了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "e800480301b8fb7e2e90d3d4b304f4fff74e5a5fd4a0d7c53191b301ef0f992d", "ja": "え、そんなに？　そ、そっか……。", "zh": "诶，有那么夸张吗？这、这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a8b0ea145a9c40e0ed89a4cdf68fc71622dd9c5feea6811db5e51225dc07e791", "ja": "で、でも、真ちゃんも詩を書いて、それを私が朗読する\nなら、道連れというか、一蓮托生というか……。", "zh": "可、可是，真也写诗，再由我来朗读的话，  \n那就算是一起下水……或者说，一荣俱荣、一损俱损……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "f887be60ff04f5e6cbd241ad70e6a6b0683fad2cac5cc5424963f8e979a90a08", "ja": "ボクも書くの？　うーん。\nキャッチコピーとかなら、たまに考えるけど……。", "zh": "我也要写吗？嗯……\n如果是宣传语之类的，偶尔会想想，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5c750f623dd696b864dcf4035775016570aae20d4a96e55e495b6e1e49ad09e2", "ja": "よく鏡の前で練習してるよね。詩も、言いたいことを\n言葉にするのは一緒だから、真ちゃんも書けると思う！", "zh": "你经常在镜子前练习呢。作诗也是把想说的话\n用语言表达出来，所以我觉得真也一定能写出来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "dcd75796e07236076fd0f91c4bd68223dfaeaa245a3a12ee0a42fc855fb04e4c", "ja": "ボクが……詩人に……！　よーしっ、そこまで\n言ってもらえるなら、ちょっと考えてみるよ！", "zh": "我……要成为诗人……！好——既然你都这么说了，那我就稍微考虑一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1025_null", "source_sha256": "77f682c7e947dc9078fa4b8ba512fe92d2c5fba430f3fe2adc68ca93a9c144fd", "ja": "20分後……", "zh": "20分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "86326c42c3b24eeed5a61ed9694c0ad435361ce81f566ddc79fe46f94cab814c", "ja": "できた～！\n初めてだから、あんまりうまくないと思うけど……。", "zh": "完成啦～！\n因为是第一次，我觉得可能做得不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dc9b50b676069ba31b96eb091261cfcc24cd2e596c1c91e8f5af9387f5c6695b", "ja": "うまいとか関係ないよ？　詩は、思いをそのまま\n紡ぎ出すことから始まるの。", "zh": "写得好不好没关系的哦？写诗，就是从直接\n吐露心声开始的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "eb783780f9b19640d7fd4adebf9e4b15062883ba3a15c815e6a9f06c0b164c42", "ja": "真ちゃんはいつも真っすぐだから、きっと、\n詩を書くのに向いてると思うなぁ。", "zh": "小真总是直来直往的，我觉得她一定很适合写诗呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "cb9107c64bd496e525cd4410b33650ad6959733c36922c7c0e6893683477137f", "ja": "えへへ、どうかなぁ～♪\nとりあえず、読んでみるね！　……コホン。", "zh": "嘿嘿，怎么样呀～♪\n总之，我先读读看！……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "6a57f9c59d89d96792b541917474c94293617ff153e512d447afdc2b17799ba2", "ja": "『ライブが決まったハッピッピ～♪\n雪歩と一緒にがんばるゾッ！』", "zh": "『演出确定啦，开心开心～♪\n要和雪步一起努力喽！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "2a182474a3426d521dc5dc340106c3b97fa317e673f77690b38eae7ac853d837", "ja": "『キラキラズッキュンステージで～♪\nみんなのハートをキュンキュンさせるナリ～♪』", "zh": "『在闪闪发亮正中红心的舞台上～♪\n让大家的心都小鹿乱撞是也～♪』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "f5f68e3a1b04e476ebe76a4152edec276ee90689fc9c6f8785dbf7cc78424517", "ja": "ふぅ……どうかな？\n今の気持ちを、ボクなりに表現してみたんだ！", "zh": "呼……怎么样？\n我试着用自己的方式表达了一下现在的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c40c0a23eb8d307602ed2e7fa5ba3793a9a6348f7d8dab378f3a038fbb47af32", "ja": "ハッ！　え、えっと……\nすごく……、ま、真ちゃんらしいと思うっ！", "zh": "哈！那、那个……\n我觉得非常……很、很有小真的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "331ba3e624ef3c8c112efca3db71b5f3e9a5bdbb8c4f9fb3362ee4fe9a48fd0f", "ja": "ホント！？　へへっ、まいったなぁ～。\nボクって意外とそっちの才能が……。", "zh": "真的！？嘿嘿，真是拿我没办法呀～  \n原来我在那方面还挺有天赋的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1036_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2a79095c8b8c7c7673c3b45a16b882de6162b5226f129a313866c7e517a354ba", "ja": "ででででもぉ！　よく考えたらファンのみんなは、\n真ちゃんのダンスを見たがってるかも！", "zh": "可可可可是！仔细想想，粉丝们\n说不定会更想看小真的舞蹈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a4f2799fc14772ca346201e3f72cb0c01e7f0def67afab16cc2f290246c15d2c", "ja": "だ、だから、真ちゃんの詩は……また今度にしたほうが\nいいような……うう、私が言ったのにごめんなさい～！", "zh": "所、所以，真的诗……还是改天再听比较好吧……呜呜，明明是我先提的，对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "8c9d8bd6f8805bb156c6adc981015f03e94e6d235edffe3a42b66467314a6f61", "ja": "うわっ、いいってば！　確かに、言われてみれば\nその通りだと思うし。あ、でも……。", "zh": "哇，没事的啦！确实，仔细一想\n也正如你所说的那样。啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "94f9307f3d4439151786801990e9027bf6d79912353b818635d58cd61fb0ee50", "ja": "ボクが踊るなら、雪歩も踊らないとね！\nさぁ……二人で一緒に踊ろうか♪　なんちゃって！", "zh": "如果我跳舞的话，雪步也得一起跳才行！\n来吧……我们两个人一起跳吧♪　开玩笑的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1040_004yuk", "source_sha256": "57f78738485ecd6394760f1346d802ff184c6ed0a66c0b96b937a3bfcabd15bb", "ja": "（はう！　真ちゃん、王子様みたい……！）", "zh": "（呜哇！真像王子一样……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "055ea795ab599aed27c7d1aeb09b78a3fc47af2bf1148b42cf0aa2f66dc6a495", "ja": "あれ、雪歩？　どうしたの？", "zh": "哎，雪步？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1042_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3df8544cf7429eca3073afabbf5f5f7d3436902f46d48920def2cfe128fb1a88", "ja": "ハッ！　な、なんでもないよ？\nえへ、えへへへへへ……♪", "zh": "哈！没、没什么啦？\n欸嘿、欸嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "20ed417371181f919f5b56dc7438d29cc48bdf9cffa7d0fca8c9cc926ea59352", "ja": "（翌日。真と雪歩から\n『二人で物語を作ってみます』と連絡が届いた……）", "zh": "（第二天，收到了真和雪步发来的消息，说“我们试着两个人创作一个故事”……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
